  "chapter": "STARTING_OUT_WITH_LINES",
  "description": "§dTitanium§r is an essential advanced metal, renowned for its exceptional strength and corrosion resistance. Its intricate production begins with §aRutile§r, primarily obtained from processing §eIlmenite§r or §eBauxite§r ores.

The purification of §bTitanium§r is a multi-stage process. §aRutile§r is first transformed into §aTitanium Tetrachloride§r. This compound is then cooked in an EBF with §eMagnesium Dust§r, yielding §aHot Titanium Ingots§r, which require cooling in a §bVacuum Freezer§r.

§r§l§6Crucial Detail:§r During this process, only the §o§6Rutile content is consumed§r§o. This makes efficient §aRutile acquisition§r good for sustainable §bTitanium§r production.

Given its high-tier applications in demanding structures and components, establishing a robust §dTitanium loop§r is a major progression milestone.",
